OL,3,GNEWSASupport network aims to help
OL,4,Athousands more veterans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA support network that has helped
OL,7,Fformer soldiers find work, access
OL,8,Fspecialist services and combat
OL,9,Fisolation is hoping to reach thousands
OL,10,Fmore veterans across Gloucestershire.
OL,12,FThe HIVE, which stands for Help,
OL,13,FInformation, Volunteer and Exchange, is
OL,14,Ffunded by Forest of Dean District
OL,15,FCouncil and brings together veterans,
OL,16,Fserving personnel and their families.
OL,18,FBritish nuclear test veteran Captain
OL,19,FTerry Hughes says it has been a
OL,20,Flifeline: "I've been coming since the
OL,21,Ffirst one and I think they're
OL,22,Fexcellent."
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
