OL,3,GNEWSASupport network aims to help
OL,4,Athousands more veterans
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers now hope to raise enough
OL,7,Fmoney to take that help directly into
OL,8,Fcommunities, particularly in rural
OL,9,Fareas where veterans may be harder to
OL,10,Freach.
